<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh Apr inflation up 0.69 pct,4.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh Apr inflation up 0.69 pct,4.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's consumer prices rose 0.69 percent in April against 0.46 percent in March, the central bank officials said on Monday.</p>
<p>The year-on-year rise was 4.84 percent.</p>
<p>    BANGLADESH CONSUMER PRICES</p>
<p>				    April	March     April 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change    0.69	 0.46     -0.6</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	4.84	 3.5	 2.73</p>
<p>    Index (base 1973-74=100) 865	  859	 825</p>
